            <ArticleTitle>The association between maternal exposure to pollutant particulate matter 2.5 and neonatal congenital heart defects: a systematic review protocol.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>2257-2264</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.11124/JBISRIR-2016-003284</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText Label="REVIEW QUESTION" NlmCategory="UNASSIGNED">The objective of this review is to identify if there is an association between maternal exposure to pollutant particulate matter 2.5 during the first trimester of pregnancy and neonatal congenital heart defects within the first year of life.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
